OL,3,GNEWSAThird man charged in connection
OL,4,Awith stab murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third man has been charged with
OL,7,Fconspiracy to murder after the death of
OL,8,Fa man who was fatally stabbed outside
OL,9,Fhis home.
OL,11,FZeshaan Shaukat, 34, died in hospital
OL,12,Fon 28 August, three days after he was
OL,13,Fattacked on Ashville Avenue, Hodge
OL,14,FHill, Birmingham at about 23:50 BST on
OL,15,F25 August.
OL,17,FNaeem Mirza was charged with conspiracy
OL,18,Fto murder and was due to appear at
OL,19,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,20,FTuesday, West Midlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
